  "details": "I instance hop a lot so I can find a lobby that matches the vibes I'm in the mood for. Too many kids? Hop. Too much toxicity? Hop. Everyone's sitting at the mirror instead of playing the game? Hop. You get it by now, I'm sure.\nHowever, I often end up in the same exact instances I've already been to, because remembering the string of random numbers and/or letters is kinda tough for me.\nCould there be some kind of icon on instances you've already been to? Maybe like, a stamp, similar to the Favorites star or something, but on specific instances.\nIf not, then some kind of Instance History would be great.\nThe time they remain marked can be hourly, or just for the session. But some way to be able to identify which instances you've been in would be nice.",
